<string_table>
	<string id="st_homestead_settlement_flag">
		<text>Settlement Flag</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_homestead_settlement_flag_descr">
		<text>A pole and banner that marks the ground as yours. Placing it founds a settlement here, just like a Workshop bench, and it flies the colours of your faction. It is also the camp's main storage: use it to open 300 kg of settlement storage. Picking it up dismantles the settlement. Weighs 6 kg to carry.</text>
	</string>
